# Fabrication Foundry: "{2}{W}, {T}, Exile one or more other artifacts you control with total mana value X: Return target artifact card with mana
# value X or less from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only as a sorcery." X is announced first (CR 601.2b, 602.2b), then the
# target chosen (CR 601.2c) and the cost paid: the artifacts exiled come to exactly X in mana value (CR 118.3, 202.3).
# Turn 1 Bot1 builds Mox Pearl, Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Sol Ring (mana value 1), Fellwar Stone (2) and the Foundry (2). Turn 2 Bot2 casts a Mana
# Vault (1) and two Shatters: one destroys Bot1's Fellwar Stone, the other Bot2's own Mox Jet. Turn 3 Bot1 casts a Mind Stone (2).
# X = 2 is announced. The Foundry itself (mana value 2, "other") and Bot2's Mana Vault ("you control") are not what is exiled; Sol Ring (1) alone
# does not come to 2. Bot2's Mox Jet in its own graveyard is no target (mana value 0, and "your graveyard"); the Fellwar Stone, with mana value
# 2 exactly at the limit, is. The Mind Stone is exiled; the Sol Ring and the Foundry stay, and the Fellwar Stone returns.

